    },
    "start": "m0_0001",
    "benefit_id": "",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "m0_0001",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "检查室里暂时没有患者。桌上的报告按日期排成整齐的一叠，屏幕上还停留着刚核对过的影像资料。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0001",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0002",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0002",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "工作台前站着一名年轻女医生。白大褂穿得整齐利落，姿态端正，容貌出众。她正低头核对报告，眉目间透着一股不好敷衍的认真。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0002",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0003",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0003",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "坂口在门边敲了两下。她将眼前一行记录写完，才抬起头，看了看他的胸牌。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0003",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0004",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0004",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "坂口隆司医生？",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0004",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0005",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0005",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "是。我是坂口隆司，最近来院任职。初次见面，打扰了。",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0005",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0006",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0006",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "深山佳織。外科为主，目前也负责急诊工作。请多指教。",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0006",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0007",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0007",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "深山朝他略一点头，伸手与他短暂一握。礼节周到，却没有借此多寒暄半句。",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0007",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0008",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0008",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "院长提过您的履历。海外研修经历很出色。",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0008",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0009",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0009",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "承蒙院长信任。不过履历归履历，实际工作还得从头做起。",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0009",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0010",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0010",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "这倒是句妥当话。患者不会因为您的履历漂亮，就变得容易处理。",
        "expression": "competitive_smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0010",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0011",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0011",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "确实如此。",
        "expression": "competitive_smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0011",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0012",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0012",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "尤其在手术台上。临床判断如何，履历替不了您回答。",
        "expression": "competitive_smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0012",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0013",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0013",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "我明白。也希望以后有机会和深山医生共事。",
        "expression": "competitive_smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0013",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0014",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0014",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "机会自然会有。到时候，我更在意您做了什么，而不是您在哪里学的。",
        "expression": "competitive_smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0014",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0015",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0015",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "那样评价最公平。",
        "expression": "competitive_smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0015",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0016",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0016",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "深山看了他片刻，唇角略微扬起，像是对这个回答尚可接受。她把手中的报告夹合好，终于不再一边工作一边听他说话。",
        "expression": "competitive_smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0016",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0017",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0017",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "冒昧问一句。深山医生，深山総一郎教授与您有亲属关系吗？",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0017",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0018",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0018",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "深山正要放下报告夹，手指顿了一瞬。方才的笑意淡了。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0018",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0019",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0019",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "是我父亲。",
        "expression": "serious",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0019",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0020",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0020",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "原来如此。我在海外拜读过他的论文。是位令人敬重的外科教授。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0020",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0021",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0021",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "谢谢。父亲在那个领域的研究，确实很值得学习。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0021",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0022",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0022",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "深山医生选择外科，想必也受过他的影响吧。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0022",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0023",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0023",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "当然。但如果您想知道我有没有本事，家父的名字恐怕帮不上忙。",
        "expression": "competitive_smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0023",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0024",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0024",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "抱歉，我无意以您的家世代替对您的判断。",
        "expression": "competitive_smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0024",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0025",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0025",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "那就好。我也一样，不会因为院长称赞过您，就省掉自己的判断。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0025",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0026",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0026",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "应该的。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0026",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0027",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0027",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "毕竟以后真在手术台上合作，谁也不能靠名声替对方承担责任。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0027",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0028",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0028",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "她把报告夹重新打开，神色恢复了原先那种有条不紊的平静。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0028",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0029",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0029",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "我在国内医大受训，主要做外科，如今也兼顾急诊。您在海外研修多年，接触过的临床流程想必不同。可以谈谈您的判断习惯吗？",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0029",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0030",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0030",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "当然。深山医生想从哪方面谈起？",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0030",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0031",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0031",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "假如急诊转来一份腹痛病例，报告只写着『情况平稳，建议外科观察』——坂口医生，您会直接接下这个结论吗？",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0031",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0032",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0032",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "不会。我会先确认症状起始、检查时间，以及检查之后的变化。否则『平稳』两个字没有依据。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0032",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0033",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0033",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "嗯。至少不是听到『平稳』就松口气。",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0033",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0034",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0034",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "深山医生通常会怎样处理？",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0034",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0035",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0035",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "先把事实说全。什么时候开始痛，检查什么时候做，之后又发生了什么；哪些风险已经排除，哪些还没有。信息不全，就先弄清楚；该决定的时候，也不能一味拖延。",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0035",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0036",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0036",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "您不喜欢把判断留给下一班。",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0036",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0037",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0037",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "我不喜欢的是，明明该有人负责判断，却人人都只肯说『再看看』。如果确实需要开刀，我会把理由说清楚，也会承担自己的决定。",
        "expression": "competitive_smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_m0_0037",
            "label": {
              "zh_CN": "继续  ▷",
              "en": "Continue  ▷"
            },
            "next": "m0_0038",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "m0_0038",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "明白。看来和深山医生合作，会很有挑战性。",
